{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'if [[ -n \"${TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID:-}\" ]]; then\n  print -r -- \"$TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID\"\nelse\n  print -r -- \"NO_TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID\"\nfi\nrg --files -g '\"'AGENTS.md' -g '\"'!**/.temp/**'\"' . ..\ntask-board q --format compact 'get(TASK-260720-8nxlgx) { full }'\ntask-board q 'project_config()'\ngit status --short --branch\ngit rev-parse HEAD\ngit branch --show-current\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'if [[ -n \"${TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID:-}\" ]]; then\n  print -r -- \"$TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID\"\nelse\n  print -r -- \"NO_TASK_BOARD_RUN_ID\"\nfi\nrg --files -g '\"'AGENTS.md' -g '\"'!**/.temp/**'\"' . ..\ntask-board q --format compact 'get(TASK-260720-8nxlgx) { full }'\ntask-board q 'project_config()'\ngit status --short --branch\ngit rev-parse HEAD\ngit branch --show-current\"","aggregated_output":"id:TASK-260720-8nxlgx\ntype:task\nname:protected-build-cache-windows\ntitle:Implement protected Windows build cache\nstatus:reviewing\nreview:required\ntask_class:code\nestimate:{\"kind\":\"notEstimated\"}\nobservability:{\"readiness\":{\"advisoryBlockedElementIds\":[],\"blockedElementIds\":[],\"coverage\":{\"complete\":false,\"estimated\":0,\"ratio\":\"0/1\",\"total\":1,\"unestimated\":1},\"estimateKind\":\"notEstimated\",\"isAdvisoryBlocked\":false,\"isBlocked\":false,\"rolledEstimate\":{\"kind\":\"estimated\",\"scale\":{\"kind\":\"fibonacci\",\"number\":0}}},\"scope\":{\"id\":\"TASK-260720-8nxlgx\",\"name\":\"protected-build-cache-windows\",\"type\":\"task\"},\"summary\":{\"active\":[{\"id\":\"TASK-260720-8nxlgx\",\"name\":\"protected-build-cache-windows\",\"status\":\"reviewing\"}],\"blocked\":[],\"byType\":{\"bug\":{\"total\":0,\"todo\":0,\"active\":0,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0},\"epic\":{\"total\":0,\"todo\":0,\"active\":0,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0},\"story\":{\"total\":0,\"todo\":0,\"active\":0,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0},\"task\":{\"total\":1,\"todo\":0,\"active\":1,\"done\":0,\"closed\":0,\"blocked\":0}}}}\nparent:STORY-260720-1uv5gi\nassignee:[reviewer] reviewer (codex)\ndescription:Implement the Windows backend for the protected immutable build cache with DACL ownership, reparse-point containment, handle-safe access, and hard-link defenses.\nscope:Own src/csk/builds/cache_windows.py and Windows-specific tests while preserving the backend co