andidate path or bytes.\n849654:+- EVIDENCE: native Windows backend suite 16/16 and full suite 783 passed / 144 skipped with a process-only PowerShell policy bypass; local cache contract 42 passed / 16 skipped, full suite 853 passed / 74 skipped, strict mypy 65 files, Ruff, build, Twine, compile and diff gates all exit 0.\n849655:+- ANOMALY: native full-repository mypy exits 1 on 51 pre-existing Windows platform-stub errors outside this backend. The task module itself passes `mypy --platform win32 --follow-imports skip`; local strict full-repository mypy is green.\n849659: - REWORK: `TASK-260720-2g21eg` cycle 4 closes both cycle-3 review findings. The hidden installed CLI mode now dispatches only after consuming a fresh manager-created secret from an inherited anonymous pipe; the secret is absent from argv, environment, request data and public proof. Literal and programmatic hidden arguments reach argparse and exit 2 without starting Go.\n849667:- Protected Windows backend in [cache_windows.py](/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-8nxlgx/worktree/src/csk/builds/cache_windows.py)\n849668:- Windows backend selection in [cache.py](/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-8nxlgx/worktree/src/csk/builds/cache.py)\n849669:- 16 native security cases in [test_build_cache_windows.py](/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-8nxlgx/worktree/tests/test_build_cache_windows.py)\n849673:- Native Windows backend: 16 passed, exit 0\n849674:- Native Windows full pytest: 783 passed, 144 skipped, exit 0\n849675:- Local full pytest: 853 passed, 74 skipped, exit 0\n849676:- Strict local mypy: 65 files, exit 0\n849677:- Ruff, build, Twine, compile, and diff checks: exit 0\n849679:The pre-existing native full-repository mypy errors and initial PowerShell-policy test failure are documented honestly in the attached [implementation evidence](/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills/.temp/TASK-260720-8nxlgx/worktree/.temp/TASK-260720-8nxlgx/TASK-260720-8nxlgx_implementation-evidence.md). Changes remain unstaged and uncommitted.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
